% Conference presentations: one file shared by the LaTeX CV (printed under
% "Selected Presentations", ACS format) and the website (publications page).
%
% Entry type: unpublished, with these fields:
%   eventtitle  meeting name; include a leading "the" where English needs it
%               (the website drops it)
%   venue       city, region/country  (US: "City, ST")
%   eventdate   ISO date or range: 2025-12-15/2025-12-20, or just 2026-05
%   year        same year as eventdate (the website groups entries by year)
%   type        poster / oral / invited talk ...
%   number      optional poster or paper number, printed after the type
%   addendum    optional award, printed as a final sentence
%   selected    {true} to include it in the resume (the full CV lists everything)
% Add author+an = {N=highlight} to bold the N-th author (your own name); add
